\title{Fine-tuning}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{fine-tuning}
\tag{post-training}

\p{Fine-tuning continues parameter optimization from a pretrained artifact.
The term names a relation between an initial checkpoint, training records, an
objective, and an update process. It does not by itself specify instruction
data, preference feedback, or reinforcement learning.}

